# Third-party licences

Licences of the code that the `dpmread` and `dpmread-gui` binaries contain.
Generated by `cargo about` from `rust/about.hbs`; do not edit by hand.
Code derived from OpenCV and NumPy, and the libraries the Linux zip ships
next to `dpmread-gui`, are listed in `NOTICE`.

